  m_Name: Mines
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DevSidePage
  leftPageInfo: '<align=center><size=140%>- Mine -</size></align>

    a Mine is
    a villager building, you can have multiple at a time.


    <align=center><size=120%>-
    Usage -</size></align>

    Assign villagers to mine various <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>materials</i></size></color>
    for your village.


    every material has their own time to <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>mine</i></size></color>
    and <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>collect</i></size></color>.'
  leftPageLayout: 1
