  rightPageInfo: '<align=center><size=120%>- Stats -</size></align>

    A miner
    mines <size=80%><i>(Per Hour | Shift)</i></size>:

    - <b>Iron:</b> <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>3</i></size></color>
    <size=90%><i>(24 / shift)</i></size>

    - <b>Copper:</b> <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>1.6</i></size></color>
    <size=90%><i>(12.8 / shift)</i></size>

    - <b>Quartz:</b> <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>1</i></size></color>
    <size=90%><i>(8 / shift)</i></size>

    - <b>Titanium:</b> <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>0.5</i></size></color>
    <size=90%><i>(4 / shift)</i></size>'
